HEAD of a pull request at the moment it was reviewed. Base commit: 5696fe4f26ce2133f2860b629699022c5c5623b5. Head commit: 617785f6239bfdf457007b5910eb07153ecbb5fe (current HEAD).
Inspect the change with `git diff 5696fe4f26ce2133f2860b629699022c5c5623b5..617785f6239bfdf457007b5910eb07153ecbb5fe` and by reading code at head and at base (`git show 5696fe4f26ce2133f2860b629699022c5c5623b5:<path>`).
